          human: "You've got one plus and one minus. Your hand after exchange: J♥ 9♥ A♥ K♠ Q♠ 10♣. Hearts trump gives you the top three trumps (BooNaAk!). You could bid Boonaak (all tricks) — but failure means you buy drinks. Bid 80 instead?",
          ai: 'Game: Boonaken. Dutch Jass. 4-7 players. 32-card deck. Jass trump order: J-9-A-K-Q-10-8-7. 6 cards each + centre card exchange. Bid types: Number (multiples of 5), Misère, Zwabber, Boonaak. Roem = card combinations announced at trick 1, can be cancelled. Can trump when able to follow suit. 2 wins = safe, 2 losses = buy drinks.',
        },
